flowchart TB
    Browser["Browser · HTML / CSS / JavaScript"]
    HTTP["FastAPI routes and Pydantic schemas"]
    Error["Exception handler"]
    Facade["PeerRoomsApp · frozen views"]
    Services["Student · Room · Connection · Discovery · Notification"]
    Domain["Entities · room states · value objects · events"]
    Ports["Repository · EventPublisher · EventListener · Clock"]
    Adapters["In-memory repositories · EventBus · clocks"]
    Bootstrap["build_app() · one composition root"]

    Browser -->|"JSON + X-Student-Id"| HTTP
    HTTP -->|"one use case per route"| Facade
    HTTP -.->|"PeerRoomsError"| Error
    Facade --> Services
    Services --> Domain
    Services --> Ports
    Adapters -.->|"implements"| Ports
    Bootstrap -.->|"injects dependencies"| Facade
